WEBVTT

01:38.270 --> 01:41.070
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.120 --> 01:43.990
[Episode 25]

01:47.560 --> 01:48.070
Wang.

01:48.950 --> 01:49.479
Wang.

01:50.150 --> 01:50.840
Kuan.

01:51.280 --> 01:52.000
Kuan.

01:53.350 --> 01:54.310
Next is…

01:55.560 --> 01:56.170
Lu.

01:56.200 --> 01:56.640
Lu.

01:57.150 --> 01:57.680
Yi.

01:57.840 --> 01:58.430
Yi.

01:59.710 --> 02:00.350
Guang.

02:04.830 --> 02:05.560
Can you read?

02:05.700 --> 02:06.350
Yes,

02:06.430 --> 02:07.400
of course.

02:13.590 --> 02:14.540
How do you pronounce this?

02:14.540 --> 02:15.760
[Ganshan Clinic]

02:16.710 --> 02:18.170
I think this means "walk."

02:18.800 --> 02:19.560
I got it.

02:19.579 --> 02:20.510
This is "Gan."

02:21.030 --> 02:22.870
This character looks like a mountain.

02:22.870 --> 02:24.000
I know, it's "Shan."

02:24.640 --> 02:26.640
-Ganshan Clinic.
-Ganshan Clinic.

02:28.560 --> 02:29.710
Ganshan Clinic?

02:32.110 --> 02:33.510
Where is Ganshan Clinic?

02:34.940 --> 02:36.060
In Shendu City.

02:37.630 --> 02:38.590
Shendu City?

02:49.370 --> 02:50.020
Xuanye.

03:20.960 --> 03:21.560
Xuanye?

03:22.960 --> 03:24.750
Why are you drinking alone out here?

03:24.750 --> 03:25.560
Feeling down?

03:27.630 --> 03:28.430
Drink with me.

03:31.000 --> 03:32.280
I'll pass on the wine.

03:32.590 --> 03:34.510
I'm going back to the government office later.

03:34.510 --> 03:35.930
I'll just chat with you for a bit.

03:35.930 --> 03:37.590
I've been in a bad mood lately.

03:38.890 --> 03:39.520
Why?

03:40.120 --> 03:41.329
Sima Lingying left,

03:41.560 --> 03:42.490
and it upset you?

03:43.000 --> 03:43.560
Her?

03:44.590 --> 03:45.960
I wanted her gone.

03:48.000 --> 03:49.720
You two like each other.

03:50.240 --> 03:51.150
There's no one

03:51.210 --> 03:52.140
and nothing

03:52.260 --> 03:53.720
standing between you two.

03:54.360 --> 03:55.470
You should treasure

03:55.470 --> 03:56.800
a connection like that.

03:58.470 --> 03:59.960
If you really like her,

04:00.100 --> 04:00.910
stop saying

04:00.910 --> 04:02.000
hurtful things.

04:02.910 --> 04:04.310
When she's heartbroken,

04:04.680 --> 04:06.040
you'll regret it.

04:06.570 --> 04:07.810
What makes you think

04:07.830 --> 04:08.620
I like her?

04:09.710 --> 04:10.680
The Commissioner and I

04:10.680 --> 04:11.750
are from different worlds.

04:11.750 --> 04:13.410
How could I possibly like her?

04:14.750 --> 04:16.550
You're too deep in it

04:16.920 --> 04:17.779
to see clearly.

04:19.829 --> 04:21.040
You mean,

04:21.829 --> 04:23.160
I don't even know

04:23.180 --> 04:23.920
who I like,

04:24.160 --> 04:25.800
and an outsider like you

04:25.830 --> 04:27.390
knows better about my feelings

04:27.390 --> 04:28.270
than I do?

04:30.870 --> 04:32.070
So you don't like her?

04:34.659 --> 04:36.390
I don't want to talk about this.

04:38.600 --> 04:40.750
Do you often think about

04:41.070 --> 04:43.530
-what happened in the painting?
-Chief Chu.

04:46.240 --> 04:46.840
Chief Chu.

04:47.430 --> 04:48.240
A body was found in a well

04:48.240 --> 04:49.510
during excavation in the north of the city.

04:49.510 --> 04:51.840
Lord Geng wants you to go there instantly.

04:58.430 --> 04:59.040
Make way.

04:59.080 --> 05:00.680
Official business, make way.

05:00.680 --> 05:01.240
Make way.

05:02.950 --> 05:03.810
Step back a bit.

05:06.070 --> 05:08.020
It's usually peaceful around here.

05:08.020 --> 05:08.390
It is?

05:08.390 --> 05:08.870
No one

05:08.870 --> 05:10.120
saw it coming.

05:12.240 --> 05:12.560
Sir,

05:12.920 --> 05:14.000
can you tell us

05:14.040 --> 05:14.970
what's going on?

05:15.240 --> 05:16.070
Enough. It has nothing to do

05:16.070 --> 05:16.480
with you.

05:16.480 --> 05:17.880
What a strange way to die.

05:18.800 --> 05:20.000
Except for the skull,

05:20.360 --> 05:21.760
all bones are shattered.

05:22.160 --> 05:23.430
Looks like the victim

05:23.630 --> 05:24.950
was run over…

05:26.830 --> 05:28.090
by something massive.

05:32.070 --> 05:32.630
Chief,

05:33.159 --> 05:34.690
we found this near the body.

05:34.830 --> 05:36.430
It might belong to the victim.

05:36.430 --> 05:38.090
Let Physician Jiu take a look.

05:42.000 --> 05:42.900
[Guangping County]

05:45.480 --> 05:47.350
[Zhang Pu]

05:52.670 --> 05:54.510
Why the long face?

05:54.909 --> 05:56.310
Still can't find a place?

05:58.290 --> 05:59.409
It's so hard.

06:01.370 --> 06:03.460
With my parents here,

06:03.490 --> 06:04.740
there's no spare room at my place

06:04.740 --> 06:05.620
for you to stay.

06:06.110 --> 06:07.550
The houses available now

06:07.950 --> 06:08.750
are either too remote,

06:08.750 --> 06:09.580
too run-down,

06:09.870 --> 06:11.070
or too expensive.

06:11.800 --> 06:12.480
Seriously,

06:12.680 --> 06:14.190
Guangping is a vast city

06:14.560 --> 06:15.770
with so many houses.

06:15.800 --> 06:16.860
Are they all taken?

06:17.630 --> 06:18.600
Is there not one

06:18.600 --> 06:20.190
that I can rent for cheap?

06:21.190 --> 06:22.480
I'm young

06:22.630 --> 06:24.480
and working hard to save money,

06:25.920 --> 06:27.020
but how come I can't even afford

06:27.020 --> 06:27.970
to rent a house?

06:28.480 --> 06:29.560
Don't stress.

06:30.040 --> 06:30.830
It happens that

06:30.830 --> 06:31.560
I've got

06:31.560 --> 06:32.960
nothing to do these days.

06:33.000 --> 06:34.159
I'll help you look.

06:40.130 --> 06:40.930
Have some too.

06:42.630 --> 06:43.430
No, thank you.

06:43.740 --> 06:45.370
I've gained weight from not working for days.

06:45.370 --> 06:47.030
My manager told me to cut back.

06:47.620 --> 06:48.950
I'll just watch you eat.

06:49.590 --> 06:50.220
Alright.

07:01.640 --> 07:02.340
My Lady.

07:03.110 --> 07:04.840
-Where are you going?
-Banxia!

07:06.190 --> 07:07.150
The victim, Zhang Pu,

07:07.150 --> 07:08.080
was 40 years old.

07:08.920 --> 07:10.630
Years ago, he bought himself a position

07:10.630 --> 07:11.180
at the government office

07:11.180 --> 07:12.440
as a market inspector.

07:12.820 --> 07:14.090
He was a heavy drinker,

07:14.120 --> 07:15.040
bad-tempered,

07:15.190 --> 07:16.390
and often skipped work.

07:16.390 --> 07:17.120
Over time,

07:17.830 --> 07:18.390
his colleagues

07:18.390 --> 07:19.920
acted as if he didn't exist.

07:20.070 --> 07:20.830
His last check-in

07:20.830 --> 07:21.890
was half a year ago.

07:22.160 --> 07:23.040
After that, no one

07:23.040 --> 07:24.100
ever saw him again.

07:25.120 --> 07:26.320
No one looked for him?

07:28.310 --> 07:29.920
Market inspector is a cushy job—

07:29.920 --> 07:30.680
just helping manage

07:30.680 --> 07:32.680
street vendors for the government.

07:32.680 --> 07:33.430
He paid

07:33.430 --> 07:34.630
for the post,

07:34.870 --> 07:35.310
and his superiors

07:35.310 --> 07:36.510
knew what he was like.

07:36.830 --> 07:38.280
After failing to find him a few times,

07:38.280 --> 07:39.280
they just gave up.

07:40.800 --> 07:41.800
What about his family?

07:41.800 --> 07:43.040
He was an only child.

07:43.070 --> 07:44.270
His parents are gone.

07:45.360 --> 07:46.960
He had a wife named Xingxian,

07:47.010 --> 07:48.210
who lives right here.

07:51.620 --> 07:52.250
Here?

07:55.240 --> 07:56.970
You really didn't have to come.

07:57.409 --> 07:59.270
I've got nothing else to do today.

08:00.130 --> 08:00.990
Suit yourself.

08:15.000 --> 08:16.000
Who are you looking for?

08:16.000 --> 08:17.330
Are you Zhang Pu's wife?

08:18.000 --> 08:18.750
Yes.

08:22.170 --> 08:23.100
I'm a constable.

08:27.480 --> 08:27.950
My Lord.

08:29.750 --> 08:31.410
Do you know where your husband

08:31.600 --> 08:32.429
is now?

08:32.909 --> 08:36.190
[Xingxian]

08:33.390 --> 08:34.950
Is something wrong?

08:35.770 --> 08:36.880
My husband has been

08:36.909 --> 08:38.039
gone for half a year.

08:38.480 --> 08:39.539
If that's the case,

08:40.030 --> 08:41.429
why didn't you report it?

08:42.030 --> 08:43.030
Well, you see,

08:43.440 --> 08:44.800
he's a heavy drinker

08:44.960 --> 08:47.000
and often goes traveling with friends.

08:47.000 --> 08:48.840
Sometimes, he'd be gone for three

08:48.840 --> 08:49.700
to five months.

08:50.000 --> 08:51.910
That's why I didn't report it.

08:53.360 --> 08:54.480
May I ask, My Lord,

08:54.790 --> 08:56.550
has something happened?

09:02.150 --> 09:02.750
He's dead.

09:03.320 --> 09:03.960
He...

09:04.400 --> 09:05.660
He's dead?

09:07.200 --> 09:08.080
Dead?

09:10.270 --> 09:11.730
He drank himself to death?

09:12.750 --> 09:13.630
This Zhang fellow

09:13.630 --> 09:15.080
was no good.

09:15.360 --> 09:16.360
Drinking all day,

09:16.600 --> 09:17.500
and when drunk,

09:17.520 --> 09:18.600
he beat his wife.

09:18.800 --> 09:20.130
I've said it before—

09:20.150 --> 09:21.670
if he kept drinking like that,

09:21.670 --> 09:23.550
he'd drink himself to death sooner or later.

09:23.550 --> 09:24.390
Did I ask you?

09:30.750 --> 09:31.630
Xingxian,

09:32.270 --> 09:33.620
you must stay strong.

09:35.520 --> 09:36.850
My condolences, madam.

09:37.180 --> 09:39.240
Come to the government office within three days

09:39.240 --> 09:40.240
to claim the body.

09:40.360 --> 09:40.910
Yes.

09:41.560 --> 09:42.490
You come with me.

09:55.120 --> 09:56.610
[Lv Sanlang]

10:24.360 --> 10:26.090
Multiple scrapes on the limbs,

10:26.420 --> 10:27.620
all recent injuries.

10:28.070 --> 10:29.390
Judging by the torn clothing,

10:29.390 --> 10:31.390
they were likely caused by the fall.

10:40.240 --> 10:42.170
His neck is dislocated and broken.

10:44.440 --> 10:46.170
No obvious signs of poisoning.

10:46.480 --> 10:47.340
Silver needle.

11:01.270 --> 11:02.330
Indeed, no poison.

11:03.240 --> 11:04.480
The only fatal wound

11:04.910 --> 11:05.710
is on the neck.

11:07.240 --> 11:08.440
On such a sunny day,

11:08.480 --> 11:11.210
he actually fell and broke his neck just walking.

11:16.350 --> 11:17.150
What's wrong?

11:23.460 --> 11:31.120
[Guangping Government]

11:33.040 --> 11:34.570
That guy didn't die, did he?

11:37.760 --> 11:38.360
Banxia.

11:38.750 --> 11:40.080
Do you know that person?

11:42.600 --> 11:43.440
No?

11:44.340 --> 11:45.870
Then why did you follow him?

11:46.390 --> 11:47.250
It felt like...

11:48.030 --> 11:50.160
like you knew something would happen.

11:50.820 --> 11:51.740
My Lady.

11:52.480 --> 11:53.360
Did you see

11:53.360 --> 11:54.560
the white crow again?

12:01.240 --> 12:02.170
What white crow?

12:03.370 --> 12:04.450
It's so eerie.

12:04.600 --> 12:06.200
I'll tell you about it later.

12:22.120 --> 12:22.600
Banxia,

12:23.290 --> 12:24.740
did you really see

12:24.790 --> 12:26.450
that white crow on Lv Sanlang?

12:27.780 --> 12:29.110
Is he really dead?

12:31.980 --> 12:33.460
If only I could've

12:33.490 --> 12:34.150
warned him.

12:34.860 --> 12:35.620
But I...

12:38.440 --> 12:39.030
Banxia,

12:39.840 --> 12:40.700
don't be upset.

12:41.120 --> 12:42.270
It's not your fault.

12:43.200 --> 12:44.690
If you blame yourself

12:44.790 --> 12:46.340
and feel sad about this,

12:46.650 --> 12:47.390
isn't that exactly

12:47.390 --> 12:49.050
what that Mirror Demon wants?

12:50.550 --> 12:51.080
Yeah.

12:51.910 --> 12:52.720
We all know

12:52.720 --> 12:53.980
you're kind by nature.

12:54.240 --> 12:55.570
But the world is so vast,

12:55.600 --> 12:57.030
and people die in accidents

12:57.030 --> 12:58.030
every single day.

12:58.440 --> 12:59.930
You can't put all the blame

12:59.960 --> 13:01.000
on yourself.

13:01.840 --> 13:02.640
Yes, Banxia.

13:03.080 --> 13:04.000
You once saved my life

13:04.000 --> 13:05.460
because of the white crow.

13:05.990 --> 13:06.910
It's getting late.

13:06.910 --> 13:08.510
Head back and have some rest.

13:11.150 --> 13:12.270
I need to go to Sifang Street

13:12.270 --> 13:13.360
to take care of something.

13:13.360 --> 13:14.360
I'll go with them.

13:15.440 --> 13:16.050
If you leave,

13:16.050 --> 13:17.850
who will fill out today's forms?

13:18.240 --> 13:19.360
You can't do it?

13:20.440 --> 13:21.380
I can, I can.

13:21.600 --> 13:22.400
It's just that

13:22.630 --> 13:23.960
there are quite a few forms today.

13:23.960 --> 13:25.320
If I made mistakes again,

13:25.320 --> 13:26.750
you'd nag me tomorrow.

13:26.970 --> 13:28.770
It'd raise your blood pressure.

13:31.170 --> 13:32.060
My incompetent colleague

13:32.060 --> 13:32.840
can't do without me.

13:32.840 --> 13:34.440
Then I won't see you off.

13:41.960 --> 13:43.360
Thank you, thank you.

13:45.550 --> 13:46.220
Xuanye.

13:46.440 --> 13:48.290
What was that guy's name?

13:48.480 --> 13:49.270
Does he have

13:49.270 --> 13:50.030
any family?

13:51.480 --> 13:53.010
Still thinking about that?

13:57.200 --> 13:57.800
Tingzhou.

13:58.550 --> 13:59.870
Are the two of them...

14:00.670 --> 14:01.320
What?

14:02.080 --> 14:02.750
You know.

14:08.080 --> 14:08.680
Together?

14:09.630 --> 14:10.120
Well,

14:10.440 --> 14:12.200
I'm not sure about Physician Jiu,

14:12.200 --> 14:13.150
but Miss Duan

14:13.150 --> 14:14.000
does like him.

14:15.160 --> 14:16.270
I knew it!

14:16.720 --> 14:18.850
I thought something was off last time.

14:21.000 --> 14:21.880
Physician Jiu!

14:25.320 --> 14:26.270
I didn't mean

14:26.290 --> 14:27.960
to interrupt your conversation.

14:27.960 --> 14:29.720
It's just that it's getting late,

14:29.720 --> 14:30.850
and I'm a bit hungry.

14:31.120 --> 14:33.050
How about we have dinner together?

14:33.120 --> 14:34.320
Aren't you on a diet?

14:36.000 --> 14:36.910
I'm hungry.

14:37.480 --> 14:38.750
No food, no energy.

14:39.110 --> 14:40.570
No energy, no weight loss.

14:44.610 --> 14:45.480
That restaurant is good.

14:45.480 --> 14:46.340
Let's go there.

14:49.630 --> 14:50.550
Let's go.

14:52.790 --> 14:53.700
I'm a bit tired.

14:53.960 --> 14:54.840
You all go ahead.

14:54.840 --> 14:55.600
I'll pass.

14:56.600 --> 14:57.320
Come on.

14:58.000 --> 14:58.960
Three pretty girls are

14:58.960 --> 15:00.290
inviting you to dinner.

15:00.360 --> 15:01.440
You've got to come!

15:01.660 --> 15:02.450
You guys go.

15:03.080 --> 15:04.080
I'll head back.

15:12.360 --> 15:14.220
Being a matchmaker is difficult.

15:14.470 --> 15:15.940
You're right to be unsure.

15:16.390 --> 15:17.270
I told you so.

15:30.550 --> 15:31.150
Youhuang.

15:31.840 --> 15:32.440
Youhuang?

15:34.120 --> 15:34.980
Are you hungry?

15:35.050 --> 15:36.310
Why are you eating ink?

15:42.080 --> 15:42.880
What's wrong?

15:43.120 --> 15:44.860
You've been uneasy lately.

15:47.360 --> 15:48.420
Is it that obvious?

15:53.510 --> 15:54.330
What's wrong?

15:58.720 --> 15:59.230
Sit.

16:05.960 --> 16:08.490
There's something that's been confusing me.

16:08.670 --> 16:10.600
I don't know who to talk to about it.

16:11.840 --> 16:12.440
Me.

16:14.480 --> 16:16.940
Ever since we left the world in the painting,

16:17.390 --> 16:19.990
I've kept dreaming about what happened there.

16:20.950 --> 16:21.880
In the painting,

16:22.090 --> 16:24.420
I was the county commandant of Guangping.

16:24.550 --> 16:25.810
My parents were alive.

16:26.810 --> 16:27.890
I was even married.

16:30.080 --> 16:31.110
Do you know who my wife was

16:31.110 --> 16:32.040
in the painting?

16:33.600 --> 16:34.360
Who?

16:36.720 --> 16:37.360
Banxia.

16:42.230 --> 16:43.120
Don't laugh!

16:43.150 --> 16:43.670
Well,

16:43.750 --> 16:45.810
it was all just a painting, wasn't it?

16:45.960 --> 16:47.560
What confuses me most is that

16:47.940 --> 16:49.610
it seems impossible for me to move on

16:49.610 --> 16:50.660
from that world.

16:52.550 --> 16:53.570
And I'm not sure

16:54.990 --> 16:55.990
if Banxia has

16:56.020 --> 16:57.420
the same feelings as I do.

16:58.080 --> 16:59.320
Now every time I see her,

16:59.320 --> 17:00.750
something feels off.

17:07.480 --> 17:08.970
Youhuang, here's the thing.

17:08.970 --> 17:11.079
The painting

17:11.400 --> 17:12.920
drawn by that demon

17:13.030 --> 17:14.030
was fake.

17:16.030 --> 17:16.680
Moreover,

17:17.000 --> 17:17.750
to me, Banxia

17:18.480 --> 17:20.280
treats you like a normal friend.

17:21.089 --> 17:21.680
Really?

17:23.550 --> 17:24.150
Youhuang,

17:24.720 --> 17:25.970
you must have noticed

17:26.000 --> 17:27.859
that Banxia likes Xuanye, right?

17:28.550 --> 17:30.200
Banxia likes Xuanye?

17:31.640 --> 17:32.840
How is that possible?

17:34.000 --> 17:34.640
Youhuang,

17:34.960 --> 17:36.090
you're so clueless.

17:36.550 --> 17:38.070
All of us have noticed it.

17:38.960 --> 17:39.760
And honestly,

17:39.940 --> 17:41.090
I'm almost certain

17:41.200 --> 17:42.860
that Xuanye likes Banxia too.

17:45.720 --> 17:47.480
Have you ever seen Xuanye

17:47.480 --> 17:50.280
be so attentive and considerate to another woman?

17:55.880 --> 17:56.480
Youhuang.

17:58.550 --> 17:59.830
As someone who's been through it,

17:59.830 --> 18:01.630
let me give you a piece of advice:

18:02.790 --> 18:04.720
cherish the one in front of you.

18:11.530 --> 18:11.930
No.

18:13.300 --> 18:14.560
The one in front of you.

18:14.810 --> 18:15.330
Go away.

18:46.720 --> 18:48.350
Uncle Duan, please get up.

18:48.790 --> 18:49.720
I have come today

18:50.640 --> 18:51.640
to ask for a favor.

18:52.310 --> 18:53.570
Please stand up first.

18:58.110 --> 19:00.310
I can never repay you for saving my life.

19:01.070 --> 19:02.600
You saved my entire family.

19:03.010 --> 19:03.600
I'd

19:03.880 --> 19:05.160
do anything

19:05.590 --> 19:06.920
to return your kindness.

19:06.920 --> 19:07.590
However,

19:08.890 --> 19:10.370
if you ask me to repay it

19:10.400 --> 19:12.240
with my daughter's hand in marriage,

19:12.240 --> 19:12.830
I…

19:14.720 --> 19:15.720
can't do it.

19:17.960 --> 19:18.890
Physician Jiu,

19:19.350 --> 19:20.550
you're good-looking

19:20.860 --> 19:23.120
and have inherited your family's craft.

19:23.480 --> 19:24.240
You're also

19:24.720 --> 19:25.830
well-educated.

19:26.240 --> 19:28.570
Though not from a wealthy or noble family,

19:28.680 --> 19:30.160
you still have servants.

19:31.140 --> 19:32.380
From what I've seen,

19:32.680 --> 19:34.720
you've got a calm, refined nature.

19:35.480 --> 19:36.310
And above all,

19:36.640 --> 19:38.680
you saved my whole family.

19:39.590 --> 19:40.270
Even if

19:40.550 --> 19:41.920
I were picky,

19:42.240 --> 19:43.900
I couldn't find a single flaw.

19:44.510 --> 19:45.110
But…

19:47.200 --> 19:48.530
there's just one thing—

19:51.000 --> 19:52.440
you're a demon hunter.

19:53.710 --> 19:54.820
I don't want

19:55.240 --> 19:57.520
my daughter involved in anything

19:57.830 --> 19:59.490
related to demons ever again.

20:08.580 --> 20:11.170
[Ganshan Clinic]

20:20.000 --> 20:21.400
What does it say up there?

20:21.690 --> 20:22.770
Capital.

20:23.480 --> 20:24.590
Capital?

20:25.670 --> 20:26.870
Isn't it Shendu City?

20:27.160 --> 20:28.690
Shendu City is the capital.

20:29.070 --> 20:30.930
Are you a foreigner or something?

20:55.320 --> 20:56.900
My leg!

21:01.260 --> 21:02.960
You knocked me over and want to walk away?

21:02.960 --> 21:03.680
Listen,

21:04.310 --> 21:05.630
you're not going anywhere

21:05.630 --> 21:06.790
unless you pay me!

21:08.070 --> 21:08.750
What?

21:17.590 --> 21:18.110
A demon?

21:42.350 --> 21:43.480
Do you know Manying?

21:43.480 --> 21:44.480
No idea, no idea.

21:44.480 --> 21:45.270
Let's go.

21:45.270 --> 21:45.800
Let's go.

21:51.090 --> 21:52.220
Do you know Manying?

21:54.030 --> 21:55.490
I never heard of that name.

21:57.750 --> 21:59.610
Sir, are you looking for someone?

22:01.070 --> 22:02.680
Do you know where Manying is?

22:04.030 --> 22:04.960
Of course I know.

22:05.160 --> 22:06.260
Come with me, sir.

22:10.680 --> 22:14.320
[Establish Virtue]

22:20.350 --> 22:21.010
Where is he?

22:23.070 --> 22:23.870
Right inside.

22:47.680 --> 22:48.550
You audacious demon!

22:48.550 --> 22:50.550
How dare you sneak into the capital?

22:50.620 --> 22:51.350
Where did you

22:52.020 --> 22:52.940
get that thing?

22:53.160 --> 22:53.960
Cut the crap.

23:32.920 --> 23:33.520
After him.

23:34.110 --> 23:34.850
-Yes.
-Yes.

23:52.310 --> 23:53.460
Help!

23:53.920 --> 23:55.270
Somebody help!

23:55.790 --> 23:57.590
D-Don't come closer!

23:57.750 --> 24:00.590
H-Help, help!

24:00.720 --> 24:01.680
Stay back, stay back!

24:01.680 --> 24:03.000
Alright, alright.

24:03.000 --> 24:04.050
We're in the middle of nowhere.

24:04.050 --> 24:05.650
Who's gonna hear you scream?

24:07.260 --> 24:08.410
What a pity.

24:08.880 --> 24:09.640
What a pity.

24:11.240 --> 24:12.900
I heard that monks can achieve

24:13.000 --> 24:15.550
enlightenment by feeding themselves to tigers.

24:15.550 --> 24:17.480
I guess feeding wolves might work too.

24:17.480 --> 24:18.880
Too bad I'm not a monk.

24:19.110 --> 24:20.800
My flesh is going to be wasted.

24:21.810 --> 24:22.550
Young Master,

24:22.550 --> 24:24.080
what are you talking about?

24:25.110 --> 24:26.910
Look carefully at these wolves.

24:27.070 --> 24:28.200
They look fierce,

24:28.830 --> 24:30.440
but they're skin and bones,

24:30.550 --> 24:32.090
clearly having a hard time.

24:33.100 --> 24:34.630
Truly, all beings suffer.

24:36.660 --> 24:39.670
[Li Xian]

24:36.750 --> 24:37.680
My wolf friends,

24:38.590 --> 24:39.250
let's talk.

24:40.110 --> 24:41.310
Could you please

24:41.310 --> 24:42.240
spare our lives?

24:42.400 --> 24:43.260
How about this?

24:45.030 --> 24:45.790
We'll leave

24:46.540 --> 24:47.510
all our food

24:47.770 --> 24:48.450
to you.

24:48.530 --> 24:49.790
When we get to the city,

24:51.280 --> 24:53.340
we'll bring back good meat in return.

24:56.400 --> 24:58.060
If that's not sincere enough,

24:59.240 --> 25:01.680
you can take one of my coachman's legs as collateral.

25:01.680 --> 25:02.350
How's that?

25:03.440 --> 25:04.550
They seem okay with it.

25:04.550 --> 25:05.440
No.

25:05.970 --> 25:07.160
Time to make a sacrifice.

25:07.160 --> 25:08.500
Y-Young Master, please don't!

25:08.500 --> 25:10.430
-Please don't!
-Make a sacrifice.

25:10.640 --> 25:11.440
Young Master, please don't!

25:11.440 --> 25:12.240
Sir, be careful!

25:12.240 --> 25:12.680
Sir!

25:12.680 --> 25:13.350
Shut up.

25:14.550 --> 25:15.680
Don't provoke them.

25:32.480 --> 25:33.480
It's alright now.

25:35.930 --> 25:36.730
They're gone?

25:38.030 --> 25:39.430
They've really all left.

25:40.310 --> 25:41.310
Thank you so much!

25:43.400 --> 25:44.110
I am Li Xian.

25:44.390 --> 25:45.350
Li, from the saying about misattribution;

25:45.350 --> 25:46.370
Xian, meaning virtue over beauty.

25:46.370 --> 25:47.430
I'm from Yuanzhou.

25:47.740 --> 25:48.930
My father is the governor there.

25:48.930 --> 25:49.790
I'm the third among

25:49.790 --> 25:50.720
three brothers.

25:50.920 --> 25:52.080
My two elder brothers are both

25:52.080 --> 25:52.540
at home,

25:52.540 --> 25:54.110
helping our father with things.

25:54.110 --> 25:55.450
Because of my love for music,

25:55.450 --> 25:56.240
I hold the position of

25:56.240 --> 25:57.590
ritual instruments keeper in Yuanzhou.

25:57.590 --> 25:58.350
My two elder brothers

25:58.350 --> 25:59.480
are both married.

25:59.790 --> 26:00.310
I've also been

26:00.310 --> 26:01.640
engaged for a long time.

26:02.110 --> 26:02.960
I'm on my way

26:03.120 --> 26:03.580
to bring

26:03.590 --> 26:04.410
my fiancée

26:04.440 --> 26:06.020
to Yuanzhou for our wedding.

26:06.020 --> 26:07.750
That's my self-introduction.

26:08.100 --> 26:08.660
May I ask,

26:08.790 --> 26:09.590
what's your name?

26:09.590 --> 26:10.460
Where do you fall in your family?

26:10.460 --> 26:11.540
Are you married?

26:12.000 --> 26:13.030
My name is Jiu Xuanye.

26:13.030 --> 26:14.230
Second in the family.

26:14.550 --> 26:15.950
Nice to meet you, Xuanye.

26:17.060 --> 26:17.850
Xuanye,

26:17.880 --> 26:18.960
where do you live?

26:19.300 --> 26:20.340
Why are you alone

26:20.360 --> 26:21.760
in these wild mountains?

26:22.750 --> 26:24.150
I live in Guangping City.

26:25.070 --> 26:25.880
Guangping?

26:26.680 --> 26:28.070
What a coincidence!

26:28.240 --> 26:28.920
My fiancée

26:28.920 --> 26:30.160
also lives in Guangping.

26:30.160 --> 26:30.750
We're going there

26:30.750 --> 26:31.830
to bring her back.

26:32.250 --> 26:32.650
If

26:32.670 --> 26:34.110
you're planning to return home,

26:34.110 --> 26:35.370
why not travel with us?

26:39.070 --> 26:39.790
How far is this place

26:39.790 --> 26:41.350
from Guangping City?

26:42.550 --> 26:43.030
How far?

26:44.200 --> 26:45.920
Young Master, this is

26:46.240 --> 26:47.250
the outskirts of Tanzhou.

26:47.250 --> 26:48.140
About three miles ahead

26:48.140 --> 26:49.100
is Tanzhou City.

26:49.280 --> 26:50.370
Guangping

26:50.400 --> 26:52.060
is about three days from here.

27:00.030 --> 27:00.680
Banxia.

27:01.550 --> 27:02.310
Where is he?

27:03.480 --> 27:04.210
I don't know.

27:04.230 --> 27:05.000
When I got up this morning,

27:05.000 --> 27:06.130
he was already gone.

27:12.490 --> 27:13.160
Banxia.

27:15.480 --> 27:16.230
Father.

27:19.630 --> 27:20.690
You went next door?

27:22.390 --> 27:23.970
But Xuanye isn't home.

27:24.670 --> 27:25.600
If there's nothing else,

27:25.600 --> 27:26.860
I'll go back to my room.

27:44.470 --> 27:45.870
Finally done for the day.

27:49.440 --> 27:50.030
Banxia,

27:50.550 --> 27:51.750
stop bustling about.

27:51.830 --> 27:53.430
Come and have some pastries.

27:59.330 --> 28:00.880
These cardamom cakes you made are so good.

28:00.880 --> 28:02.940
Just as good as the ones sold outside.

28:04.680 --> 28:06.210
Aren't you eating, Banxia?

28:07.550 --> 28:08.200
Banxia?

28:14.750 --> 28:15.440
What's wrong with you?

28:15.440 --> 28:16.640
You seem distracted.

28:18.310 --> 28:19.000
I'm fine.

28:20.350 --> 28:22.950
It's about your good neighbor again, isn't it?

28:23.680 --> 28:24.400
It's just—

28:24.400 --> 28:25.860
he left early this morning

28:26.110 --> 28:28.040
without saying where he was going.

28:28.200 --> 28:29.800
He didn't leave any message?

28:31.160 --> 28:32.510
He barely goes out?

28:34.960 --> 28:36.890
And he tells you every time he does?

28:38.130 --> 28:39.200
Not every time.

28:39.830 --> 28:41.790
But our relationship

28:41.830 --> 28:43.230
is kind of different now.

28:44.030 --> 28:45.030
Different how?

28:48.880 --> 28:49.590
You two took an oath

28:49.590 --> 28:50.920
to be together forever?

28:54.640 --> 28:55.640
It seems to me that

28:55.750 --> 28:56.270
you're

28:56.300 --> 28:57.700
carrying a torch for him.

28:58.440 --> 28:59.500
Last time I saw him,

28:59.640 --> 29:01.040
he didn't look too happy.

29:02.480 --> 29:03.680
He's just been

29:03.700 --> 29:04.900
a bit strange lately.

29:05.750 --> 29:07.610
What do you like about him anyway?

29:07.720 --> 29:09.320
I think he's quite ordinary.

29:09.640 --> 29:10.640
I mean, sure—

29:11.480 --> 29:13.000
he's kind of nice-looking,

29:13.000 --> 29:14.090
knows a bit of medicine

29:14.090 --> 29:15.070
and martial arts,

29:15.070 --> 29:16.510
and owns a house and shop.

29:16.800 --> 29:18.720
His wife doesn't need to serve his parents

29:18.720 --> 29:19.960
or deal with

29:19.980 --> 29:21.180
the sisters-in-law.

29:23.400 --> 29:24.350
Come to think of it,

29:24.350 --> 29:26.350
he's actually got great qualities.

29:26.700 --> 29:27.720
No wonder you like him.

29:27.720 --> 29:28.980
Even I'm a bit tempted.

29:30.790 --> 29:32.790
That's not why I like him.

29:34.880 --> 29:36.680
It's because when I'm with him,

29:36.680 --> 29:37.480
I feel at ease.

29:38.270 --> 29:39.240
At ease?

29:42.920 --> 29:44.350
No matter what I do,

29:44.440 --> 29:45.700
as long as he's around,

29:46.480 --> 29:47.880
I don't feel afraid.

29:50.990 --> 29:52.650
You've really fallen for him.

29:55.160 --> 29:56.110
Enough about me.

29:56.520 --> 29:59.240
Your house is so big and bright.

29:59.540 --> 30:01.540
It must have cost quite a bit, right?

30:02.110 --> 30:03.720
Someone just died nearby.

30:04.000 --> 30:04.960
It's considered a bit ominous,

30:04.960 --> 30:06.220
so the rent is cheaper.

30:06.480 --> 30:07.110
Besides,

30:07.380 --> 30:08.550
it's close to the market.

30:08.550 --> 30:09.480
So I moved in.

30:10.110 --> 30:12.000
You're really brave.

30:13.150 --> 30:15.150
Every patch of land buries someone.

30:15.160 --> 30:16.360
I'm not afraid at all.

30:17.270 --> 30:18.550
You vicious tramp!

30:18.830 --> 30:20.590
Vicious tramp, come out!

30:20.750 --> 30:22.550
You vicious tramp.

30:22.640 --> 30:24.060
You cheated and caused my second uncle's death.

30:24.060 --> 30:25.240
Today I'm here to get justice

30:25.240 --> 30:25.960
for my uncle!

30:25.960 --> 30:27.000
That's right! Justice!

30:27.000 --> 30:27.720
Justice!

30:27.880 --> 30:29.240
I didn't cheat. I didn't!

30:29.240 --> 30:29.840
Nonsense!

30:30.030 --> 30:31.320
If you hadn't cheated,

30:31.350 --> 30:32.400
why didn't you report it

30:32.400 --> 30:33.620
when my uncle went missing?

30:33.620 --> 30:34.630
You clearly had something to hide!

30:34.630 --> 30:35.240
Yeah!

30:35.550 --> 30:36.700
Someone like you

30:37.030 --> 30:38.310
should be expelled from the Zhang family!

30:38.310 --> 30:39.440
Yes, expel her!

30:39.440 --> 30:40.070
That's right.

30:40.070 --> 30:42.110
A heartless,

30:42.560 --> 30:44.020
unfaithful woman like you

30:44.170 --> 30:45.210
has no right

30:45.310 --> 30:46.840
to stay in the Zhang family!

30:46.980 --> 30:48.300
Right! Expel her!

30:50.730 --> 30:51.990
Everyone's watching.

30:52.830 --> 30:53.790
You vicious woman,

30:53.790 --> 30:54.920
do you admit to adultery?

30:54.920 --> 30:55.750
Do you admit it?

30:55.750 --> 30:57.070
Do you admit it? Speak up!

30:57.070 --> 30:57.480
Speak!

30:58.550 --> 30:59.160
Speak!

30:59.920 --> 31:00.720
Just admit it.

31:01.200 --> 31:02.400
Yeah, do you admit it?

31:07.640 --> 31:08.270
I admit it.

31:09.480 --> 31:11.270
I admit it's all my fault.

31:11.810 --> 31:13.890
I shouldn't have been born a woman.

31:14.830 --> 31:16.480
If I hadn't, maybe my husband's death

31:16.480 --> 31:17.480
wouldn't have brought

31:17.480 --> 31:19.160
you bullies to my doorstep!

31:19.550 --> 31:21.040
Watch your mouth!

31:21.070 --> 31:23.130
What did you just say, you vile woman?

31:23.680 --> 31:25.610
You all really think I don't get it?

31:26.340 --> 31:28.410
You act all righteous,

31:29.420 --> 31:30.380
but you just want

31:30.410 --> 31:31.400
to pin a crime on me

31:31.400 --> 31:32.090
and kick me out

31:32.090 --> 31:33.770
so you can steal my house!

31:34.090 --> 31:35.640
Lies!

31:36.520 --> 31:37.630
You filthy tramp!

31:37.650 --> 31:38.960
I'll tear your mouth apart today!

31:38.960 --> 31:40.110
-Don't!
-Hit her!

31:40.270 --> 31:41.550
Hit her! Hit her!

31:41.790 --> 31:42.440
Back off!

31:44.990 --> 31:46.360
Who are you?

31:48.480 --> 31:50.240
Never seen someone dumping slop before?

31:50.240 --> 31:52.240
I said back off, but you didn't move.

31:52.300 --> 31:53.300
Serves you right.

31:54.110 --> 31:54.790
All of you ganging up

31:54.790 --> 31:56.050
on one helpless woman—

31:56.110 --> 31:57.590
aren't you afraid of the law?

31:57.590 --> 31:59.110
Don't try to scare us with the law.

31:59.110 --> 32:00.030
Who are you?

32:00.640 --> 32:01.440
That's

32:01.460 --> 32:02.720
none of your business!

32:02.750 --> 32:04.240
You're assaulting someone in public,

32:04.240 --> 32:05.400
and she's hurt.

32:05.590 --> 32:06.550
If you don't leave,

32:06.550 --> 32:08.750
I'll report this to the government now.

32:12.030 --> 32:12.480
Fine.

32:13.830 --> 32:14.830
You win this time.

32:15.200 --> 32:15.790
But I don't believe

32:15.790 --> 32:17.160
you two can protect her forever.

32:17.160 --> 32:17.960
Just you wait.

32:18.200 --> 32:19.000
Just you wait!

32:21.720 --> 32:22.520
Are you okay?

32:26.350 --> 32:27.400
As your neighbor,

32:27.720 --> 32:28.590
I've heard a bit

32:28.590 --> 32:29.850
about your situation.

32:30.510 --> 32:32.040
Forgive me for saying this,

32:32.240 --> 32:33.200
but your husband

32:33.230 --> 32:34.230
was an alcoholic.

32:34.720 --> 32:35.480
He was rude

32:35.510 --> 32:36.400
and violent.

32:37.680 --> 32:38.480
His death

32:39.000 --> 32:40.330
must be a relief for you.

32:41.880 --> 32:43.540
Maybe you should report this.

32:43.720 --> 32:44.920
You're all alone.

32:45.340 --> 32:46.800
If they come back,

32:46.820 --> 32:47.930
what will you do?

32:50.000 --> 32:51.930
At worst, they'll beat me to death.

32:52.270 --> 32:53.720
Don't say such things.

32:53.960 --> 32:55.790
Is there no justice left in this world?

32:55.790 --> 32:57.320
You can't be afraid of them.

32:57.550 --> 32:58.310
The more fear you show,

32:58.310 --> 32:59.840
the more they'll bully you.

33:02.270 --> 33:03.960
The Sanhuai Lane

33:03.960 --> 33:05.160
really is cursed.

33:06.880 --> 33:07.400
Banxia,

33:07.720 --> 33:08.960
do you remember the man

33:08.960 --> 33:10.880
who fell to his death the other day?

33:10.880 --> 33:11.960
He lived here too.

33:18.210 --> 33:19.170
You knew him?

33:21.070 --> 33:21.750
No.

33:28.750 --> 33:29.810
I live right there.

33:30.710 --> 33:32.310
We're neighbors from now on.

33:32.480 --> 33:33.710
If you need any help,

33:33.920 --> 33:34.680
just call me.

33:36.930 --> 33:37.650
Thank you.

33:40.590 --> 33:41.240
Let's go.

34:14.510 --> 34:15.300
You again!

34:20.610 --> 34:21.960
I was about to look for you,

34:21.960 --> 34:23.489
yet you showed up yourself.

34:39.030 --> 34:40.290
Where did you get this?

34:47.590 --> 34:49.120
Do you really know Manying?

34:50.360 --> 34:51.030
Yeah, I do.

34:52.120 --> 34:53.090
Untie the rope,

34:53.239 --> 34:54.370
kneel down,

34:54.389 --> 34:55.770
and kowtow three times to me.

34:55.770 --> 34:57.430
Then I'll take you to find him.

35:00.290 --> 35:01.350
You don't know him.

35:12.180 --> 35:12.950
Xuanye.

35:15.710 --> 35:16.480
Xuanye…

35:19.900 --> 35:21.230
Then do you know Xuanye?

35:25.350 --> 35:26.200
You do.

35:26.860 --> 35:28.070
Then take me to see him.

35:28.070 --> 35:28.760
No way!

35:31.440 --> 35:33.640
Then I'll have no choice but to kill you.

35:34.690 --> 35:35.980
I don't think you will.

35:42.450 --> 35:43.980
I don't have much patience.

35:45.670 --> 35:46.230
Three.

35:49.630 --> 35:50.190
Two.

35:51.060 --> 35:51.860
I'll take you.

35:54.130 --> 35:55.260
I can take you to him,

35:56.150 --> 35:57.350
but after you see him,

35:57.560 --> 35:58.480
you have to let me go.

35:58.480 --> 35:59.070
Sure.

35:59.620 --> 36:01.280
Once I see him, I'll let you go.

36:12.590 --> 36:13.440
Physician Jiu isn't here.

36:13.440 --> 36:14.700
Come back another day.

36:15.600 --> 36:17.400
He's been gone for three days.

36:17.500 --> 36:18.490
Think carefully again.

36:18.490 --> 36:20.090
Did he say where he was going?

36:31.320 --> 36:33.250
Where have you been all these days?

36:35.510 --> 36:36.150
Banxia?

36:38.270 --> 36:39.270
It really is you!

36:40.330 --> 36:40.960
Don't you recognize me?

36:40.960 --> 36:41.890
It's me, Li Xian.

36:43.480 --> 36:44.030
Xuanye.

36:44.670 --> 36:45.400
This is Banxia,

36:45.400 --> 36:46.510
my fiancée.

36:53.870 --> 36:54.350
Sir,

36:55.220 --> 36:55.700
madam,

36:56.750 --> 36:57.980
after I heard what happened to you,

36:57.980 --> 36:58.810
I traveled day and night

36:58.810 --> 36:59.470
to get here.

36:59.960 --> 37:01.400
This is truly wonderful news.

37:01.400 --> 37:02.480
Uncle Duan has returned,

37:02.480 --> 37:04.020
and Aunt Duan has been found.

37:04.020 --> 37:05.320
When my father heard about it,

37:05.320 --> 37:06.360
he was so happy he drank

37:06.360 --> 37:07.690
three big bowls of wine!

37:07.830 --> 37:09.180
If not for his official duties,

37:09.180 --> 37:10.580
he would've come with me.

37:11.480 --> 37:12.480
It was a long journey.

37:12.480 --> 37:13.000
Xian,

37:13.100 --> 37:14.100
you must be tired.

37:14.550 --> 37:15.570
Uncle, you're so kind.

37:15.570 --> 37:16.030
We're all

37:16.030 --> 37:17.490
one family now, aren't we?

37:18.190 --> 37:18.800
Oh, right.

37:19.480 --> 37:21.960
This is Physician Jiu. His name is Xuanye.

37:22.770 --> 37:23.900
He saved my life.

37:24.590 --> 37:25.550
My journey here

37:25.960 --> 37:27.020
was full of danger—

37:27.730 --> 37:29.420
steep mountains,

37:29.590 --> 37:30.520
vicious beasts,

37:30.600 --> 37:31.860
and wolves all around.

37:31.930 --> 37:33.390
I barely made it out alive.

37:34.210 --> 37:36.420
If it hadn't been for Xuanye,

37:36.520 --> 37:37.550
who scared off the wolves

37:37.550 --> 37:38.880
with his mere presence,

37:39.290 --> 37:40.690
this fragile body of mine

37:40.940 --> 37:41.920
would've disappeared

37:41.920 --> 37:42.850
from this world.

37:43.630 --> 37:44.320
Xuanye

37:44.530 --> 37:45.880
is not only kind and righteous

37:45.880 --> 37:47.140
but also clever, wise,

37:47.220 --> 37:48.430
well-read,

37:48.630 --> 37:49.710
and talented.

37:50.460 --> 37:51.190
On our way back,

37:51.190 --> 37:51.990
we talked about

37:51.990 --> 37:54.390
astrology, geography, and local customs.

37:54.670 --> 37:56.390
We never ran out of things to say.

37:56.390 --> 37:58.990
I truly wish we had met earlier.

38:01.070 --> 38:02.330
Xian, you may not know,

38:02.760 --> 38:03.670
but we've known

38:03.690 --> 38:05.540
Physician Jiu for some time now.

38:05.960 --> 38:06.710
He also saved

38:07.590 --> 38:08.840
our whole family.

38:09.190 --> 38:10.360
What a coincidence!

38:11.070 --> 38:11.670
Xuanye,

38:12.070 --> 38:13.760
I told you we were destined to meet.

38:13.760 --> 38:15.020
We should do as I suggested—

38:15.020 --> 38:16.320
follow the ways of the ancients,

38:16.320 --> 38:17.110
drink blood wine,

38:17.110 --> 38:18.640
and become sworn brothers.

38:18.740 --> 38:19.600
But he refused.

38:23.880 --> 38:25.310
Thank you, Physician Jiu,

38:25.310 --> 38:26.560
for saving Li Xian.

38:28.650 --> 38:29.850
It's a great kindness

38:29.940 --> 38:31.070
to both the Duan family

38:31.070 --> 38:32.470
and Banxia.

38:34.480 --> 38:36.360
You must be tired

38:36.800 --> 38:38.200
after your long journey.

38:38.400 --> 38:40.440
Why don't you go home and get some rest?

38:40.440 --> 38:41.360
In a few days,

38:41.550 --> 38:43.480
I'll host a banquet at Yanlai Restaurant

38:43.480 --> 38:45.670
and invite you to drink with us.

38:48.440 --> 38:49.570
That's a great idea.

38:49.960 --> 38:50.480
Xuanye,

38:50.710 --> 38:52.230
don't turn us down then.

38:55.920 --> 38:56.480
Okay.

38:57.380 --> 38:58.440
I'll head back now.

39:04.320 --> 39:05.030
Yeah, Banxia,

39:05.030 --> 39:06.230
see Xuanye off for me.

39:06.760 --> 39:07.360
Xuanye,

39:07.550 --> 39:09.610
I'll come to thank you in person soon.

39:12.320 --> 39:12.950
Xuanye.

39:14.110 --> 39:14.760
Xuanye.

39:16.220 --> 39:17.300
As you know,

39:17.590 --> 39:18.880
I've already told my father

39:18.880 --> 39:20.320
about breaking off the engagement,

39:20.320 --> 39:22.030
and he was going to write to the Li family.

39:22.030 --> 39:23.280
I don't know why

39:23.300 --> 39:24.830
Li Xian suddenly showed up.

39:27.920 --> 39:28.830
Are you mad?

39:30.280 --> 39:31.150
I'm not mad.

39:33.280 --> 39:33.960
Really?

39:34.440 --> 39:35.070
Really.

39:36.400 --> 39:37.660
You should go back now.

39:37.840 --> 39:39.400
After all, he came here for you.

39:39.400 --> 39:40.460
Don't be impolite.

39:41.240 --> 39:41.810
But...

39:41.840 --> 39:42.800
I'm really fine.

39:45.480 --> 39:46.330
Alright then.

39:46.760 --> 39:48.280
I'll come see you later.

39:49.440 --> 39:50.000
Okay.

40:37.150 --> 40:37.950
Bodhisattva,

40:38.880 --> 40:39.740
I'm here again.

40:41.190 --> 40:42.510
Lv Sanlang is dead too.

40:43.480 --> 40:44.190
I think

40:44.590 --> 40:46.750
you must've heard my prayers

40:47.360 --> 40:49.000
and used your divine powers

40:49.480 --> 40:50.800
to punish the wicked.

40:53.000 --> 40:54.880
My life has been full of sorrow.

40:56.150 --> 40:58.670
I married Zhang Pu at 15.

41:00.760 --> 41:02.150
After we married,

41:02.440 --> 41:04.170
he drank excessively every day

41:04.670 --> 41:05.480
and beat

41:06.140 --> 41:08.470
and yelled at me over the slightest thing.

41:10.700 --> 41:11.950
After his death,

41:13.460 --> 41:15.130
my neighbor Lv Sanlang

41:15.400 --> 41:17.510
took advantage of my being alone

41:19.300 --> 41:21.430
and often harassed me.

41:23.420 --> 41:25.210
I had no one to turn to,

41:25.240 --> 41:26.200
so I came to you.

41:28.390 --> 41:29.370
But I never thought

41:29.370 --> 41:30.850
you would really listen.

41:31.840 --> 41:32.640
Bodhisattva,

41:33.400 --> 41:35.200
you've already helped me twice.

41:35.840 --> 41:37.480
I thought I could start

41:37.480 --> 41:38.960
a new life,

41:41.080 --> 41:43.270
but why is it still not possible?

41:47.590 --> 41:49.280
Is it that I don't deserve

41:50.850 --> 41:52.940
to have happiness in this life?

41:53.960 --> 41:55.840
If I were a man,

41:57.440 --> 41:59.640
everything would be different, right?

42:03.020 --> 42:03.820
Bodhisattva,

42:04.150 --> 42:05.070
please help me.

42:06.150 --> 42:08.680
This is the last time I'm asking for your help.

42:08.840 --> 42:10.190
Please show mercy.

42:11.510 --> 42:13.960
Being a woman is too painful.

42:14.670 --> 42:15.760
In my next life,

42:17.280 --> 42:18.960
please let me be a man.

42:22.110 --> 42:22.840
Take care.

42:25.320 --> 42:26.070
Banxia.

42:28.130 --> 42:29.660
Are you looking for Xuanye?

42:29.800 --> 42:30.400
Yeah.

42:30.590 --> 42:31.390
He's not here.

42:31.820 --> 42:32.680
Where did he go?

42:32.840 --> 42:33.770
He went fishing.

42:35.960 --> 42:37.160
Then I'll go find him.

42:44.310 --> 42:45.140
Chi Xue.

42:45.320 --> 42:46.580
Lend me your umbrella.

42:50.440 --> 42:51.150
I don't want

42:51.620 --> 42:53.740
my daughter involved in anything

42:54.030 --> 42:55.690
related to demons ever again.

42:56.230 --> 42:58.400
And I don't want her

42:59.840 --> 43:01.590
to marry a demon hunter.

43:16.930 --> 43:18.190
Do it!

43:27.440 --> 43:28.190
Xuanye.

43:31.800 --> 43:33.840
I've been looking for you.

43:36.000 --> 43:37.920
It's going to rain,

43:38.110 --> 43:39.230
so I brought an umbrella

43:39.230 --> 43:40.030
to pick you up.

43:45.670 --> 43:47.170
Let's go home.

43:47.340 --> 43:48.040
Once it starts raining,

43:48.040 --> 43:49.030
it'll be hard to find shelter.

43:49.030 --> 43:49.710
Banxia.

43:50.920 --> 43:52.070
I need to talk to you.

43:54.360 --> 43:55.030
Can't it wait

43:55.030 --> 43:56.420
until we get home?

43:57.230 --> 43:58.360
Let's go home first.

44:02.510 --> 44:03.710
Let's end things here.
